      "seed": 73701733,
      "version": 631,
      "versionNonce": 996781797,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789624436494,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. The Set is a child interface of Collection interface .\n\n2. Set doesn't allow duplicate element that it can only store unique\ndata .\n\n3. Set doesn't support indexing , hence Set doesn't have any get()\nmethod.\n\n4. Set doesn't gurantee to preserve insertion order .\n\n5. Set doesn't have any extra method of its own like ArrayList has\nget() and indexOf() .\n\n6. Set has 3 child classes \n\n--> HashSet\n-->TreeSet\n-->LinkedHashSet",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. The Set is a child interface of Collection interface .\n\n2. Set doesn't allow duplicate element that it can only store unique data .\n\n3. Set doesn't support indexing , hence Set doesn't have any get() method.\n\n4. Set doesn't gurantee to preserve insertion order .\n\n5. Set doesn't have any extra method of its own like ArrayList has get() and indexOf() .\n\n6. Set has 3 child classes \n\n--> HashSet\n-->TreeSet\n-->LinkedHashSet",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
