      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789624782251,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. It is a child class or implementation class of Set interface .\n\n2. As it is a child class of Set it also follow two things .\n  \n  a. It does not store duplicate elements .\n  b. It doesn't support indexing .\n\n3. Whenever elements of HashSet are displayed , the output can be in\nany random order .\nThe reason is hashing .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. It is a child class or implementation class of Set interface .\n\n2. As it is a child class of Set it also follow two things .\n  \n  a. It does not store duplicate elements .\n  b. It doesn't support indexing .\n\n3. Whenever elements of HashSet are displayed , the output can be in any random order .\nThe reason is hashing .",
